      "html": "<div class=\"ds-modes\" role=\"radiogroup\"><button role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"g\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>Off</b><span>Don't send anything.</span></button><button role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\"><span class=\"g\"><i class=\"a\"></i><i></i><i></i><i class=\"a\"></i><i></i></span><b>At set times</b><span>Start a window at the times you pick.</span></button><button role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"g\"><i class=\"a\"></i><i class=\"a\"></i><i class=\"a\"></i><i class=\"a\"></i><i class=\"a\"></i></span><b>Back to back</b><span>Start a new window the moment one ends.</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-modes{font-family:Jost,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border:1px solid rgba(168,186,224,.22);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#06080d;}.ds-modes button{font-family:Jost,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:grid;align-content:start;gap:4px;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;border:0;border-left:1px solid rgba(168,186,224,.11);background:transparent;color:#e8ecf4;transition:background .2s;}.ds-modes button:first-child{border-left:0;}.ds-modes button:hover{background:rgba(168,186,224,.05);}.ds-modes button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #bcd7ff;outline-offset:-3px;}.ds-modes .g{display:flex;gap:3px;height:8px;margin-bottom:6px;}.ds-modes .g i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(168,186,224,.18);}.ds-modes .g i.a{background:#f3b46a;}.ds-modes b{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;}.ds-modes button>span:last-child{color:#8b95aa;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;}.ds-modes [aria-checked=true]{background:rgba(243,180,106,.1);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 #f3b46a;}.ds-modes [aria-checked=true] b{color:#ffe2b0;}"
    },
